WEBVTT

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.700
The man who had come from Dotsuku 
Zone had gone back into the darkness.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.240
He had left behind one 
of the seven Prism Stones

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.540
that possess the vital force 
of every living thing.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.740
With this stone, Mepple and Mipple 
now held three of the Prism Stones.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:47.780
Will that man come back 
to get his Prism Stone?

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.020
Or...?

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.800
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.640
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.910
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.880
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.750
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.650
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:14.550
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.150
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:21.960
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:24.060
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:27.830
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.840
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:34.410
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:37.580
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:40.450
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:46.720
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:47.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.320
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.120
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:56.030
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:57.600
<i>Together we are</i>

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.670
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.260
What are we going to do with this stone?

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:12.130
We'll put it in the Prism Hopish mipo.

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:14.070
Prism Hopish?

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:18.430
It's something important from the Field 
of Light that we were entrusted with mipo.

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:21.880
It's absolutely necessary in order 
to protect the Prism Stones mipo.

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:26.220
If you put the Prism Stones in this Prism 
Hopish does that mean they're safe?

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.000
That's right.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.200
They're supposed to be kept safe by 
the Guardian of Prism Stones mipo.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:34.130
So where is this Prism Hopish?

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:38.200
Mepple was supposed to have it when he 
escaped from the Field of Light mipo.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.660
Right, Mepple?

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.510
Mepple!

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.530
Is something wrong?

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:49.440
Take out the Prism Hopish that Queen 
entrusted you with, Mepple mipo.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:53.430
I dropped it mepo.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.210
What did you just say mipo?

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:01.280
Actually, because of the impact from 
entering the Field of Rainbows, I...

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.030
You what?

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.450
I just...

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.790
You just...?

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.790
...dropped it mepo.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.560
You dropped it?!

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:11.560
No way mipo!

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.340
I'm sorry mepo!

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:21.350
"A NEW DARKNESS! 
THE BEAR IN THE DANGEROUS FOREST"

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.170
So what do you think?

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:30.810
Looking at it from above,

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.560
I didn't see any of these words 
or numbers written on it mepo.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.210
That's because this is a map.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:39.780
They're not really written on the places.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.210
Is that right mepo?

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:44.900
Mepple! Hurry, and try to remember mipo!

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.560
I'm sorry.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:54.010
I'm sure I flew around here...

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.930
That's right! There was a big pool 
of water where I dropped it mepo.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:03:59.530
A pool of water...?

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.470
Then it must be a lake or ocean.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.600
Then for example...

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:06.520
Did it look like this?

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:12.560
It looks sort of like it, but 
then again, maybe not mepo.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.370
What about this one?

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:19.060
That might be it.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:22.510
But then it might be a little different mepo.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:26.240
Then again, it could be this one here...

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:30.230
No! I have a feeling it might 
be this one, after all...

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.050
But it might be this one mepo.

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.990
Stop messing around mipo!

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:39.920
Are you okay, Misumi-san?

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.660
I'm sorry.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.790
This is the place mepo!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.130
Are you sure mipo?

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.320
There's no mistake.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.690
This is the shape of the pool of water mepo.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:52.770
Are you serious?

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:56.570
Where is Kappayama Hyotan pond anyway?

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.610
I'll be going then.

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.980
Be sure you don't get lost in the mountains.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.440
You're getting carried away.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:07.930
Don't worry so much.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:08.970
That's right...

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:12.990
Worrying about Sis is just 
a waste of time anyway.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.250
Do you want me to whack you one on the head?

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:18.690
Nagisa!

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:24.970
There's never a time when I haven't 
worried about either of you.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.220
Mom...

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:31.640
Anyway, come home before it gets dark, okay?

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:34.380
I will.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.140
I'll see you later!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:42.130
What made her suddenly decide to go hiking?

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.160
Aren't we there yet?

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:51.750
I don't feel the presence of 
the Prism Hopish yet mepo.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:55.160
Why do I have to come to a place like this,

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:57.850
and go mountain climbing anyway?

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:00.690
It certainly is a real nuisance mipo.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.750
You've really been giving 
it to Mepple, haven't you?

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:08.210
Did you really drop the Prism 
Hopish in these mountains mipo?

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.010
I'm sure of it mepo!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.100
Even if it is here by some chance,

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.910
can you find something that small mipo?

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.990
I'll sense it when we get close to it mepo!

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:20.650
That's...

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:23.000
Nagisa! What's wrong mepo?

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:23.450
Look!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:28.180
There's no mistake! That's it mepo!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.830
It's quite a beauti...

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:36.870
Thank goodness...

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:39.280
But I have a bad feeling about this.

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:44.870
Mepo!

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:46.300
Good grief!

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:48.900
Are you alive, Yukishiro-san?

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:50.950
Just barely.

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:02.750
I never thought Pisard 
would really be defeated.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.590
He didn't take them seriously enough.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:08.370
Being forced out by children like that.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.170
I'll crush them to death.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.640
That's amusing.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:20.890
Jyaku-King, sir...

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:22.380
You do that.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:26.170
Thanks to Pisard's mistake,

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.680
they got one of the stones 
back in their possession.

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:33.560
If we don't get all seven Prism Stones,

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:37.640
Dotsuku Zone won't be able 
to gain eternal life.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:42.280
Gekidrago... You can crush them,

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:45.900
but be sure you don't make the 
mistake of crushing the stones, too.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.110
Uga...

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:55.280
Listen... isn't it about 
time you sensed something?

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.670
He's sleeping.

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:00.220
How carefree...

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:03.550
Maybe I should rethink 
my feelings for him mipo.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.400
I sense something mepo.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.100
Really?

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.760
That's my Mepple mipo.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.250
That's not what you just said.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:19.590
But the last time Mepple 
said he sensed something,

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:22.120
those boys came, didn't they?

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.180
That's right.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.200
Today, we're in a place like this,

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.860
so maybe a bear will come out.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:30.910
What is it?

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.520
Don't tell me, that's...

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.460
It's a bear.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:35.870
You're kidding!

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:36.930
No way!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.460
It got caught in the current...

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:39.600
We have to save it.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:40.930
But how...?

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:44.760
We might be able to use those rocks...

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:45.900
Mepo!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.100
Take care of him for me...

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:50.400
It's dangerous, Misumi-san!

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:53.240
It's really dangerous!

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.570
I'm coming, little cub!

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:06.230
Help!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.130
Someone, help me!

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:10.930
Misumi-san! Can't you swim?

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.580
I'm not good in the water.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.330
I'm "tonkachi."

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.640
You mean "kanazuchi" (like a 
stone in water), don't you?

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:18.860
Behind you!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.360
We're saved!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:36.960
I thought I was going to die!

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.550
Give me a break, Misumi-san!

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.320
Don't make me worry so much.

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.740
That was quite a surprise.

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:47.630
Jumping into the river when you can't swim.

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:50.570
I'm sorry...

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:54.600
But all I could think of was saving 
this little bear cub here...

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:57.130
You're unbelievable.

00:09:57.850 --> 00:09:59.800
We're soaking wet.

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:03.920
In this sunshine, those wet 
clothes will just dry off.

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:06.640
Go on home to your mom.

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:11.420
It looks like it likes you, 
doesn't it, Misumi-san?

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:17.020
It's a bear!

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.710
By any chance...?

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.470
That's the little bear 
cub's mother, isn't it?

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:32.050
Don't get separated again.

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:09.340
Uga...

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:38.020
So this is the Field of Rainbows 
that Pisard It's hard to walk here.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:39.980
It's hard to walk here.

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:44.950
But I found something good.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:56.010
We finally made it.

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:58.020
I'm sure it's pond mepo.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:02.850
If you're mistaken, I hope you 
know what'll happen to you mipo!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.130
I don't know how big a pond this is,

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.930
but how are we supposed to find 
it around a pond this big?

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.510
What a lousy drawing!

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:13.250
We can't tell what it is from this drawing.

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:15.560
You should talk mepo!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:21.850
Let's look for it before it gets dark.

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:23.460
Good idea.

00:12:32.110 --> 00:12:33.370
What's that noise?

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.590
It sounds like it's headed this way.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.100
What... what is it?

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.100
It's that little bear cub.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.430
So this is where you were!

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:56.180
So they're the ones that Pisard...

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.750
Let's go, Zakenna!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.260
Zakenna!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:06.120
Transform mepo!

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:07.440
It's impossible!

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:17.160
This is our chance!

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.950
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:44.920
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.810
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:51.490
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:55.240
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.690
Go back to where you came from!

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:00.870
Uga!

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:03.750
It doesn't look like they want to go back.

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.520
Zakenna!

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:20.190
This is totally impossible.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.470
What am I going to do?

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:25.430
I'm not the athletic type to begin with.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:27.100
Uga!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:32.470
Uga?

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:34.960
I told you it's totally impossible.

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.510
Watch out, little cub.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:46.990
Zakenna!

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.040
What is it?

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:58.830
Zakenna's forehead...

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:01.170
That white patch...

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:05.940
Didn't this little cub's mother have 
the same thing on her forehead?

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:09.320
Don't tell me...

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.680
It's this little cub's mother...?

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:13.760
That's right...

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:15.940
Zakenna possessed her body.

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:16.980
I'm sure of it.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:18.130
It can't be!

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.100
Do it, Zakenna!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.130
Zakenna!

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:38.510
Good! That's good!

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:39.810
It's my turn next!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.040
Black!

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:52.050
Uga! Uga!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:02.960
Uga? Uga!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.090
He fell!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.660
What should we do?

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:12.710
We'll have to go ahead.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.210
No! You can't! It's dangerous.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.300
What should we do?

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:28.950
Isn't there some way to change 
her back to the way she was?

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:32.280
Use the Pretty Cure Rainbow Therapy mipo!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:33.770
What is that?

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:37.060
It will soothe the evil heart 
that has possessed her mepo.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:39.580
But will the mother bear be all right?

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.330
She'll be fine.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.990
Trust us mepo.

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.330
In any case, let's give it a try.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.070
Please don't move.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:54.210
What do we say?

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:57.190
Black Pulsar and White Pulsar mipo!

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:59.700
Black Pulsar!

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.020
White Pulsar!

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:11.380
You, who have been taken prisoner 
by the spell of darkness...

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.620
Sever that chain now!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:19.740
Pretty Cure Rainbow Therapy!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.600
What did I just say?

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:34.770
Zakenna!

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:40.760
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.790
Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:46.590
Thank goodness!

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:48.040
So we can do things like that, too.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.640
Uga...

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.560
Why you...!

00:18:56.560 --> 00:19:00.670
How dare you make Zakenna possess 
that little cub's mother!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:02.580
I won't allow it!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:05.320
Black Thunder!

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.070
White Thunder!

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:16.190
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:19.160
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:23.780
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:45.770
He won't be able to come out again, will he?

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:46.810
I don't think so.

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:48.880
What's that?

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:52.570
It's the Prism Hopish mipo.

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:57.860
We finally found it mipo!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.160
Take care!

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.680
We'll come, and visit again.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.310
We're not coming back!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:13.810
Put the Prism Stone in the Prism Hopish mepo.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:25.770
I'm the Guardian who 
protects the Prism Stones.

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:28.860
Are you the ones who got 
the Prism Stone back?

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.170
Yes...

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:36.140
Thank you for getting the Prism 
Stones back, young girls.

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:38.010
Young girls...?

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:40.110
You're younger than us.

